ce srcset=\"/uploads/simon-bolivar.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/simon-bolivar.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Pictorial portrait of Simón Bolívar seated, in full-dress military uniform with an embroidered red coat, holding a sword\"\n                width=\"384\"\n                height=\"520\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <div style=\"text-align:center; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n            <span style=\"display:block;\">Simón Bolívar (1783&ndash;1830), Liberator and first president of Bolivia</span>\n            <span style=\"display:block;\">Unknown author</span>\n          </div>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged portrait\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"simon-bolivar\" hidden\n             \n             class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button disabled=\"false\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); touch-action:none;\">\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/simon-bolivar.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/simon-bolivar.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Retrato de Simón Bolívar, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:calc(100vw - 16px); max-height:calc(100vh - 16px); width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Birth</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">July 24, 1783 &mdash; Caracas, Captaincy General of Venezuela</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Death</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">December 17, 1830 &mdash; Quinta de San Pedro Alejandrino, Santa Marta</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Profession</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Military and Statesman</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Key Role</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Liberator of Venezuela, Colombia, Ecuador, Peru and Bolivia; first president of Gran Colombia (1819&ndash;1830)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">1. Training and Early Life</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Born into an aristocratic Creole family in Caracas, Simón Bolívar lost both parents before the age of ten. Educated under Simón Rodríguez, he traveled to Spain and then across Europe as a young man; in Rome, according to tradition, he vowed to devote his life to freeing his homeland from Spanish rule.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Returning to Venezuela, he joined the independence movement after the First Republic (1810&ndash;1812) and began a military career that would lead him to lead campaigns across much of the South American continent.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">2. The Liberation Campaigns</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">After successive defeats and exiles, Bolívar reorganized his forces and launched the celebrated Admirable Campaign of 1813. In 1819, after crossing the Llanos and the Andes under extreme conditions, he secured New Granada's independence with victory at the Battle of Boyacá.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">He continued liberating Venezuela (Carabobo, 1821), Ecuador (Pichincha, 1822) and, together with Antonio José de Sucre, Peru and Alto Perú, which would adopt its name as the Republic of Bolivia in 1825.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">3. Gran Colombia and the Sunset</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Bolívar dreamed of a great united South American nation: the<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Greater Colombia</strong>, which brought together present-day Venezuela, Colombia, Ecuador and Panama under his presidency since 1819. However, regional tensions, rivalries with leaders such as Francisco de Paula Santander, and internal conflicts led to the fragmentation of the project around 1830.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Sick and disillusioned, he resigned the presidency and planned to go into exile in Europe when he died of tuberculosis at the Quinta de San Pedro Alejandrino, near Santa Marta, on December 17, 1830.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">4. Numismatic Legacy</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Bolívar's face is, by far, the most reproduced in the history of Colombian paper money. His portrait appears in multiple broadcasts of<a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-5-pesos-plata-1941/\">The Bank of the Republic</a>throughout the twentieth century, including the Silver Certificate of Five Pesos (1941) and the<a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-50-pesos-oro-specimen/\">Fifty Pesos Gold</a>, as well as on commemorative coins of several countries that bear his name: Venezuela (bolivar), Bolivia and the historic Fort Bolivar.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">Biography based on the Encyclopedia of the Bank of the Republic (enciclopedia.banrepcultural.org) and standard historical sources on the South American wars of independence.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:6px 0 0;\">Portrait: unknown author.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Simón Bolívar",
      "eyebrow": "Historical Profile · El Libertador"
    }
  }
